### 1. Get Server Token
POST {{api_url}}/os3/api/open/v1/auth/token
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": "{{client_id}}",
  "client_secret": "{{client_secret}}"
}

### 2. Create User
POST {{api_url}}/os3/api/open/v1/account
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{server_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "group": "{{group}}",
  "uniqueId": "sso_account_02"
}

### 3. Get User Token
GET {{api_url}}/os3/api/open/v1/account/{{account_id}}/token
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{server_token}}

### 4. Generate SSO Deeplink (PKCE)
# Purpose: Generate a secure, single-use deep link with authorization code
# PKCE Flow: code_verifier → code_challenge → auth_code → token exchange
POST {{api_url}}/os3/api/open/v1/sso/generate-deep-link
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{server_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeChallenge": "E9Melhoa2OwvFrEMTJguCHaoeK1t8URWbuGJSstw-cM",
  "codeChallengeMethod": "S256",
  "cvUserUniqueId": "{{account_id}}",
  "redirectUri": "carevoiceosdemo://callback",
  "state": "sso_from_app_a"
}

### 5. Validate SSO Deeplink (PKCE)
POST {{api_url}}/os3/api/open/v1/sso/validate-deep-link
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}
Authorization: Bearer {{server_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorizationCode": "3xuITJwGG7qCEKaqDf88GAriIDb-0lJ5QW1BZuDvrrs",
  "codeVerifier": "dBjftJeZ4CVP-mB92K27uhbUJU1p1r_wW1gFWFOEjXk"
}